story('luka','The Luka ripple','TWO PICKS.\nTWO FUTURES.','A draft-night exchange. Two careers. An afterlife nobody could have drawn up.','Dallas',2018,2026,'DAL','#6eb9fa','luka-draft-trade reddish-draft luka-lakers trae-wizards davis-wizards','luka-draft-trade','Follows the Dallas first to Cam Reddish, Luka to the Lakers, and the separate Trae Young and Anthony Davis routes to Washington. Stops February 5, 2026; later drafts and other outgoing players are untraced.','The draft-night package opens several paths. Follow one asset at a time.','luka-doncic')
story('dirk','The night Dallas changed','ONE NIGHT.\nTWO CORNERSTONES.','Dirk’s draft rights. Garrity’s next stop. The separate deal that brought Nash.','Dallas',1998,1999,'DAL','#6eb9fa','dirk-draft-trade nash-dallas marion-draft','dirk-draft-trade','Two distinct June 24, 1998 trades, then Dallas’s first conveying as Shawn Marion in 1999. No later careers or free-agent signings are drawn as trade returns.','Pat Garrity’s rights connect the two deals. Each package still matters.','dirk-nowitzki')
story('brooklyn','Brooklyn buys the present','THE LONG\nGAME.','Three firsts, one swap, and the patience between a promise and a player.','Classic',2013,2017,'BOS','#7bcea2','nets-celtics young-draft brown-draft boston-swap tatum-trade tatum-draft','nets-celtics','Follows 2014 and 2016 conveyances, the 2017 swap and Boston’s trade down to Tatum. Stops June 22, 2017. The 2018 first and Philadelphia’s future obligation are not followed.','A swap is a right to exchange picks. Boston still needed another trade to reach No. 3.','kevin-garnett')
story('kobe','Thirteen to Los Angeles','BEFORE\nTHE LEGEND.','A draft selection in Charlotte. A rights transfer two weeks later.','Classic',1996,1996,'LAL','#eac55b','kobe-draft kobe-lakers','kobe-lakers','The June 26 selection and July 11, 1996 Bryant–Divac exchange only. This is a short origin story; later free agency is outside the trade graph.','Draft night and the effective trade date are not always the same day.')
story('shaq','The dynasty splits','THE BIG\nAFTERLIFE.','From Shaq’s move to Miami to two very different Gasol destinations.','Classic',2004,2019,'LAL','#eac55b','shaq-miami kwame-lakers pau-lakers marc-raptors','shaq-miami','Follows Caron Butler into the Kwame Brown package, Brown into the Pau Gasol package, then Marc’s Toronto exchange. Other players and draft obligations stop at their recorded transfer.','The connection runs through whole packages, with additional assets entering each time.')
story('gasol','The brothers in the fine print','A TALE OF\nTWO GASOLS.','One brother headlines the trade. The other appears as draft rights.','Classic',2008,2019,'MEM','#9aaedb','pau-lakers marc-raptors','pau-lakers','The complete 2008 Gasol exchange and Marc’s 2019 Toronto trade. Pick outcomes and other subsequent player moves are not followed.','A draft-rights entry in one deal can become the headliner of another.')
story('garnett','Boston’s two big swings','ALL IN.\nTHEN RESET.','The 2007 arrival and the 2013 departure belong to different Boston bets.','Classic',2007,2017,'BOS','#7bcea2','garnett-boston nets-celtics young-draft brown-draft boston-swap tatum-trade tatum-draft','garnett-boston','Links Garnett’s 2007 acquisition to the curated Boston–Brooklyn branch through Tatum in 2017. The Minnesota-side return and later Brooklyn obligation are not followed.','Returning a team’s own pick obligation extinguishes a claim; it creates no extra pick.','kevin-garnett')
story('harden','Houston finds its headliner','THE BET\nON THIRTEEN.','The player went to Houston. Three very different draft promises went the other way.','Classic',2012,2014,'OKC','#77b8f9','harden-houston adams-draft abrines-draft dallas-pick-rolls mcgary-draft','harden-houston','Follows the Toronto and Charlotte 2013 picks and the protected Dallas obligation through its 2014 conveyance. Later player transactions are outside this story.','A protected pick can survive one draft and convey at the next. It is still one obligation.')
story('kawhi','The return trip','A LEAP.\nA LOOP.','Kawhi goes north. Years later, Poeltl’s branch circles back to Toronto.','Modern',2018,2024,'SAS','#c1c8d1','kawhi-toronto keldon-draft poeltl-toronto dillingham-draft dillingham-minnesota','kawhi-toronto','Follows Keldon Johnson and Poeltl’s return, then Toronto’s No. 8 into the Dillingham rights trade. Stops June 26, 2024 with Minnesota’s future first and swap outstanding at that point.','A returning player can open a new branch years after the original exchange.')
story('george','The price of right now','FIVE FIRSTS.\nONE FUTURE.','George arrives in Oklahoma City, then leaves in a very different kind of deal.','Modern',2017,2022,'OKC','#77b8f9','george-okc george-clippers jalen-draft','george-clippers','Includes Indiana’s 2017 exchange, the full 2019 Clippers package and the 2022 first that becomes Jalen Williams. Other pick conveyances and the Miami obligation’s later amendment are untraced.','Shai and the draft obligations arrive in the same package. Their later paths remain distinct.')
story('davis','The Davis chain','THREE CITIES.\nTHREE DEALS.','New Orleans to Los Angeles. Dallas to Washington. Follow the actual packages.','Modern',2019,2026,'LAL','#eac55b','davis-lakers luka-lakers davis-wizards','davis-lakers','The 2019, 2025 and February 5, 2026 Davis exchanges. Full packages are included; other player branches, pick conveyances and deferral decisions are outside this route.','Washington appears in the first deal as a facilitator and in the last as Davis’s destination.')
story('kyrie','Another Dallas crossroads','TWO STARS.\nMORE THREADS.','Kyrie’s arrival includes Markieff Morris. Follow the less obvious thread.','Dallas',2023,2026,'DAL','#6eb9fa','irving-dallas luka-lakers davis-wizards','irving-dallas','Follows Morris from the Kyrie package into the Luka deal, then Davis into Washington. This is not a claim that Kyrie was traded for any of those returns. Brooklyn’s picks are untraced.','Shared teammates can connect trades whose headline players never change hands for one another.')
